      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "ProotyPie Project Report",
      "style": "Title Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. Title",
      "style": "Heading Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "ProotyPie: CNN Activation-Function Comparison for Fruit Image Classification with a Submission-Ready Web Interface",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. Abstract",
      "style": "Heading Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This project delivers a submission-ready convolutional neural network (CNN) mini-project based on a documented subset of the public Fruits-360 dataset. The work compares four activation functions\u2014ReLU, Sigmoid, Tanh, and Leaky ReLU\u2014under three stochastic gradient descent (SGD) learning rates: 0.001, 0.01, and 0.1. Each configuration is trained and evaluated using accuracy, precision, recall, and macro F1-score. Training and validation loss and accuracy plots are generated for all 12 runs, and the final validation-selected model is evaluated once on a held-out official test split using a confusion matrix.",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Alongside the experiment, the project includes a polished web interface and Python API so the trained classifier can be demonstrated interactively. The interface clearly separates fruit-type classification from freshness inspection to avoid unsupported claims. The resulting system is reproducible, test-backed, and documented for academic submission.",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. Problem Statement",
      "style": "Heading Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Manual identification of fruit images is simple for humans in obvious cases, but a machine learning system must learn useful visual features and converge reliably under different optimization settings. The assignment requires a CNN image-classification system that investigates how activation functions and learning rates affect convergence and final performance.",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The practical objective of this project is therefore twofold:",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. Build and compare CNN configurations on a public dataset.",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. Present the trained model through a clean application interface suitable for project demonstration and submission.",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. Objectives",
      "style": "Heading Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 Build a CNN for fruit image classification using a public dataset.",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 Compare ReLU, Sigmoid, Tanh, and Leaky ReLU activation functions.",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 Study the effect of learning rates 0.001, 0.01, and 0.1 under SGD.",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 Evaluate performance using accuracy, precision, recall, and macro F1-score.",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 Visualize training and validation loss and accuracy.",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 Generate a confusion matrix for the final selected model.",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 Integrate the trained model into a working web application.",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 Document limitations honestly, especially the difference between fruit-type classification and freshness assessment.",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. Dataset",
      "style": "Heading Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5.1 Source",
      "style": "Heading Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 Dataset: **Fruits-360**",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 Repository: https://github.com/Horea94/Fruit-Images-Dataset",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 License reference: MIT License in the repository",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5.2 Scope used in this submission",
      "style": "Heading Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A documented subset was used so all required experiments could be completed reproducibly within the available compute budget.",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Classes used:",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 Apple Braeburn",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 Banana",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 Orange",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 Strawberry",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Image size used for training:",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 48 \u00d7 48 \u00d7 3",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Sampling policy:",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 first lexicographically ordered official JPGs",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 100 Training images per class",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 40 official Test images per class",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Final split sizes:",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 Training: 320 images",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 Validation: 80 images",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 Held-out official Test: 160 images",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Data-integrity policy:",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 SHA-256 hashes were computed across all used files",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 no overlap was allowed between train, validation, and held-out test samples",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "6. Methodology",
      "style": "Heading Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "6.1 Experimental design",
      "style": "Heading Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The project tests 12 combinations:",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 4 activation functions \u00d7 3 learning rates",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Activation functions:",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 ReLU",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 Sigmoid",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 Tanh",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 Leaky ReLU",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Learning rates:",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 0.001",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 0.01",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 0.1",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Optimizer:",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 SGD",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Epochs:",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 6",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Batch size:",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 16",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Selection rule:",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 best validation macro F1-score",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "6.2 CNN architecture",
      "style": "Heading Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A compact CNN was used to keep the comparison tractable and fair:",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 Conv2D(8, 3\u00d73)",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 chosen activation",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 MaxPooling2D",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 Conv2D(16, 3\u00d73)",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 chosen activation",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 GlobalAveragePooling2D",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 Dense(4, softmax)",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This architecture was held constant across all runs. Only the activation function and learning rate changed.",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "6.3 Evaluation metrics",
      "style": "Heading Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "For each run, the following were recorded:",
