    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "9.2 Honest capability separation",
      "style": "Heading Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The repository originally described a freshness workflow, but the required trained freshness model file was not present. Therefore, the final interface does not pretend that fruit-type classification is freshness detection.",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Current verified state:",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 fruit-type classification: **working**",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 original freshness inspection path: **not available in this snapshot**",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This separation is important for academic correctness.",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
