    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "12. Limitations",
      "style": "Heading Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 The experiment uses a documented subset of Fruits-360, not the full dataset.",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 Perfect accuracy on the held-out subset does not guarantee the same performance on real-world or open-set images.",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 The trained submission model performs **fruit-type classification only**.",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 It does not assess freshness, spoilage, or food safety.",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 Gemini-powered features require a valid API key and were not needed for the core assignment experiment.",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 The original repository freshness model file was missing, so that path remains unavailable.",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "13. Conclusion",
      "style": "Heading Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This project satisfies the assignment requirements by delivering a complete CNN comparison study on a public image dataset, including activation-function and learning-rate analysis, evaluation metrics, training curves, and a confusion matrix. Among the tested configurations, Tanh with SGD at learning rate 0.1 produced the best validation performance and achieved perfect performance on the held-out documented test subset.",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The project was also extended into a usable application interface so the trained classifier can be demonstrated clearly. Most importantly, the final submission preserves scope honesty by separating fruit-type classification from unsupported freshness claims.",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "14. File References",
      "style": "Heading Custom"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\u2022 Experiment script: `experiments/run_fruits360_experiment.py`",
      "style": "Body Custom"
    },
